Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: breeze-icon-theme
Description: outline icon theme for KDE Plasma (NeoLine, NeoLine-White, NeoLine-Yellow)
 NeoLine is a line icon theme made for the NG desktop: application, place,
 mime type, action and symbolic icons drawn with one thin outline. Three
 variants: NeoLine (follows the colour scheme), NeoLine-White and
 NeoLine-Yellow. Icons it does not have fall back on Breeze.
